[M31_PA_HarrierBullRush X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Bull Rush (Harrier)"
LocFlyOverText="Bull Rush"
LocLongDescription="Punch an enemy within movement range, stunning them for <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierBullRush_StunDuration> action(s). Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown. Cannot be used against large units."
LocHelpText="Punch an enemy within movement range, stunning them for <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierBullRush_StunDuration> action(s). Cannot be used against large units."
