[M31_PA_HarrierPunch X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Unhinged Behavior"
LocFlyOverText="Unhinged Behavior"
LocLongDescription="Punch an enemy within blue movement range. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has no cooldown. Cannot be used against inanimate objects."
LocHelpText="Punch an enemy within blue movement range. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Cannot be used against inanimate objects."
LocPromotionPopupText="<br><font color='#909497'>You can ask me: \"Merist, why is this a thing? Why a unit with a grenade launcher as primary weapon would go and punch someone in the face?\" And the answer is quite simple- because it's funny.<br><br>In all seriousness, I think that having a bar fighter muton is quite fitting."

[M31_PA_HarrierEndOfGeneva X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="End of Geneva"
LocFlyOverText="End of Geneva"
LocLongDescription="It's not a war crime if you win. Cooldown of all Harrier Launcher attacks is reduced and they no longer end the turn."
LocHelpText="It's not a war crime if you win. Cooldown of all Harrier Launcher attacks is reduced and they no longer end the turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Cooldown reduction depends on the ability."

[M31_PA_HarrierFineControl X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Fine Control"
LocLongDescription="Harrier Launcher attacks no longer affect allies."
LocHelpText="Harrier Launcher attacks no longer affect allies."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Note that terrain effects left by these abilities can still affect allies."

[M31_PA_HarrierVileMix X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Vile Mix"
LocLongDescription="Your damage-over-time effects deal <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierVileMix_DOTDamageBonus> additional damage. Your grenades and Harrier Launcher attacks apply a stackable debuff that increases the damage the enemies take from damage-over-time effects by <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierVileMix_DOTDamageBonus_Debuff> for <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierVileMix_Duration> turn(s)."
LocHelpText="Your damage-over-time effects deal <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierVileMix_DOTDamageBonus> additional damage. Your grenades and Harrier Launcher attacks apply a stackable debuff that increases the damage the enemies take from damage-over-time effects by <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierVileMix_DOTDamageBonus_Debuff> for <Ability:M31_PA_HarrierVileMix_Duration> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The debuff will increase the damage from damage-over-time effects from all sources.<br><Bullet> The debuff doesn't stack."

[M31_PA_HarrierBlasterMaster X2AbilityTemplate]
